{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2024-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1733616000, "end_date": 1734307199, "month_true_total": 361, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:54:32 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "182850981", "author": {"steamid": "76561198376664278", "personaname": "Remitah", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198376664278/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 657, "last_played": 1787704528, "avatar": "a41bba94e272038c2f62d704f0b8e689592e52e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "great", "timestamp_created": 1734299598, "timestamp_updated": 1734299598, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182848748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329246475", "personaname": "Tellar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tellar_/", "num_games_owned": 372, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 1582, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1491, "last_played": 1737844067, "avatar": "85f0bd65908ee81ad446aeb1b4907c36c060adfa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still not yet the perfect rougelike fps but it's getting there", "timestamp_created": 1734297461, "timestamp_updated": 1734297461, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182845167", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006924965", "personaname": "Please, Be Kind", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bobntg/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2182, "last_played": 1789497296, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is just plain fun. Progression is simple to understand and you can really play at your own pace and still have a lot of fun no matter what your play style is.\r\n\r\nWhen I first got it, I would mostly just play this single player whenever I wanted to play a game but didn't have a lot of time to get into one. I never really thought too much about builds or my abilities or anything but always enjoyed the fast game play, weapon variety and just seeing how far I could make it into a run.\r\n\r\nAfter the last update, I found a friend who also had the game and we have really enjoy playing co-op! We can each progress at our own pace and still play together. Plus the variety of weapons and characters allows us to try different strategies and weapon combinations and really keeps things fresh. We still haven't made it to the end yet but we're having a lot of fun experimenting and learning.", "timestamp_created": 1734294271, "timestamp_updated": 1734294271, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182840069", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116133065", "personaname": "Sweg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/neroisbad/", "num_games_owned": 854, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 1906, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1545, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1545, "last_played": 1754244537, "avatar": "3c